    "headline": "Lake Wind Advisory issued October 22 at 1:58PM PDT until October 24 at 8:00AM PDT by NWS Reno NV",
    "description": "* WHAT...East winds 10 to 20 mph with gusts up to 40 mph and waves 2\nto 4 feet for Lake Tahoe.\n\n* WHERE...Greater Lake Tahoe Area.\n\n* WHEN...From 8 PM Friday to 8 AM PDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create\nhazardous conditions for small craft.",
